      "text": [
        "<h2>The statistical data is divided into three sections:</h2>",
        "<ul><li>Federal level (without separate accounts)</li><li>General government level (Confederation including separate accounts, cantons, communes and <br>  social insurance)</li><li>International comparison</li></ul>",
        "<p>The publication is available in English, French, German and Italian, and can be obtained free of charge from the FOBL under <a href=\"https://www.bundespublikationen.admin.ch/de/product/000000000862734774/public-finances-2025\">article number 601.002.ENG</a></p>",
        "<p><a href=\"https://www.bundespublikationen.admin.ch/de/product/000000000862734774/public-finances-2025\"></a>The electronic version as well as additional information can be found at: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.efv.admin.ch/en/statistical-data-publ\">www.efv.admin.ch/statisticaldata</a>.</p>"
      ],
